// The generic `fs.*` RPC family behind the Files pane ("Hangar"):
// crates/srv/src/server/fs_handlers.rs, docs/specs/SPEC_FILE_BROWSER_PANE_2026_10_01.md
// §6.3, §7. Every type is generated by ts-rs from
// crates/srv/src/backend/rpc_types/fs.rs.
//
// Live updates for a watched folder arrive as the `files:changed` event
// (`MpsEvents.FilesChanged`), scoped to `block:<block_id>`, with
// `{ dir }` set to the folder's path exactly as `fs.list` returns it.

